@startuml 图2-33 鲁棒图：积分清算与过期（UC-18 用例实现 · 参与者：运营管理员、系统）
' 依据：需求规格说明书用例清单；代码 apps/api/internal/httpserver 与 repo（2026-11-26）
' 鲁棒图非 UML 标准图：边界类只连 actor/控制类，实体类只连控制类。
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2E5C8A
}

actor "运营管理员 / 系统" as U

boundary "批次管理页\nAdminBatchPage" as B1
boundary "过期清算页\nAdminExpirePage" as B2
boundary "清算结果页\nExpireResultPage" as B3

control "过期清算控制器\nExpireController" as C1
control "批次过期器\nBatchExpirer" as C2
control "余额扣减器\nBalanceDebiter" as C3

entity "积分批次 PointBatch" as E1
entity "积分账户 PointAccount" as E2
entity "积分流水 PointTxn" as E3
entity "批次流水 PointBatchTxn" as E4

' ---------- 主成功场景与主要备选流 ----------
U --> B1 : 查看 ACTIVE / 过期批次
B1 --> C1 : listBatches()
C1 --> E1 : 按 expires_at 排序
U --> B2 : 手动触发清算
B2 --> C1 : expire()
C1 --> C2 : 查到期批次账户（升序）
C2 --> E2 : SELECT balance FOR UPDATE
C2 --> E1 : SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
C2 --> E1 : UPDATE remaining=0, status=EXPIRED
C1 --> C3 : deduct(account, min(remaining, balance))
C3 --> E3 : INSERT EXPIRE 流水
C3 --> E4 : INSERT 批次扣减明细
C3 --> E2 : UPDATE balance / version
C1 --> B3 : 返回 batches / points / accounts

note bottom of C1
  **实现状态：手动清算已实现，自动任务未实现**。
  POST /admin/points/expire 单事务、按账户升序加锁；
  每批次最多一条 EXPIRE 流水，重复执行幂等；
  当前没有常驻定时任务，需运营手动触发；也不写 audit_log。
end note

legend right
  边界类：B1–B3　控制类：C1–C3　实体类：E1–E4
  过期量取 min(batch.remaining, account.balance)
endlegend

@enduml
